{#
   The category icon. Takes a CATEGORY slug, not a machine.

   ⚠️ Two model facts this partial is papering over, both of which S74 has to
   fix properly:

   1. **The icon belongs to the category, not the machine.** Today `iconSlug`
      is a column on `Machine`, so eleven machines each carry their own copy of
      "which picture represents a laser cutter". The mapping below is a stopgap
      that derives it from the category slug instead, which is where it belongs.

   2. **`MachineCategory` exists as an entity but its table does not exist in
      the database** (`MACHINE_CATEGORY` → 1146, checked on the live box). So
      categories are, today, denormalised `categorySlug`/`categoryLabel`
      strings on `Machine` and nothing else. **S74 cannot "just use
      MachineCategory" — it has to create it.** This is the pre-existing
      entity-ahead-of-migrations drift, not a broken deploy.

   ⚠️ Fills are `var(--color-primary)`, not the hardcoded `#9E1B56` the real
   page uses, so the icons follow the portal's own accent (S27) and the dark
   theme. A page full of hardcoded brand hexes is what makes a rebrand a rewrite.
#}
{% set slug = slug|default('') %}
{% set family =
    'laser' in slug or 'decoup' in slug or 'découp' in slug ? 'decoupe' :
    ('electro' in slug or 'électro' in slug or 'pcb' in slug ? 'electronique' :
    ('usin' in slug or 'cnc' in slug or 'fraise' in slug or 'metal' in slug ? 'usinage' :
    ('textile' in slug or 'coutur' in slug or 'brod' in slug ? 'textile' : 'impression')))
%}
<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="machine-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    {% if family == 'decoupe' %}
        <rect x="16" y="28" width="68" height="44" fill="var(--color-primary)" rx="6"/>
        <path d="M26 42h48M26 58h48" stroke="var(--theme-surface)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M38 22l24 56" stroke="var(--color-text-light)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    {% elseif family == 'electronique' %}
        <rect x="18" y="24" width="64" height="52" fill="var(--color-primary)" rx="7"/>
        <circle cx="36" cy="50" r="8" fill="var(--theme-surface)"/>
        <circle cx="62" cy="50" r="8" fill="var(--theme-surface)"/>
        <path d="M28 74v12M50 76v10M72 74v12" stroke="var(--color-text-light)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    {% elseif family == 'usinage' %}
        <rect x="18" y="58" width="64" height="18" fill="var(--color-text-light)" rx="3"/>
        <rect x="30" y="24" width="40" height="34" fill="var(--color-primary)" rx="5"/>
        <path d="M50 58v22" stroke="var(--theme-surface)" stroke-width="5"/>
    {% elseif family == 'textile' %}
        <rect x="18" y="30" width="64" height="38" fill="var(--color-primary)" rx="8"/>
        <path d="M36 68c8-18 20-18 28 0" stroke="var(--theme-surface)" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/>
        <path d="M50 20v58" stroke="var(--color-text-light)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    {% else %}
        <rect x="20" y="30" width="60" height="40" fill="var(--color-primary)" rx="5"/>
        <rect x="25" y="20" width="50" height="10" fill="var(--color-text-light)" rx="2"/>
        <circle cx="50" cy="75" r="8" fill="var(--color-text-light)"/>
    {% endif %}
</svg>
